OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Marines abseil to launch
OL,4,APoppy Appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Marines have abseiled into a
OL,7,Fshopping centre to launch this year's
OL,8,FPoppy Appeal.
OL,10,FShoppers watched as the marines climbed
OL,11,Fdown from the roof inside Westquay
OL,12,Fshopping centre in Southampton.
OL,14,FAllen Parton, a disabled Royal Navy
OL,15,Fveteran who attended the launch, said
OL,16,Fthe Poppy Appeal had helped him get his
OL,17,Ffirst wheelchair.
OL,19,FThe Royal British Legion charity said
OL,20,Fit hoped to raise more than #50m this
OL,21,Fyear to support serving personnel,
OL,22,Fveterans, and their families.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
